# UNDERDELVE: the mine lifts stand still until Mo has the gear crank. With
# it, the lift in the fork's ledge room rises to the ledge and waits there;
# Mo steps across and strikes the chest open for the tuning fork. Without
# the crank the ledge can't be reached from the lift.
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 2 3 196 110
cheat clear_enemies
wait 320
expect lift_y == 128
expect py == 114
cheat give 4
cheat room 2 3 196 110
cheat clear_enemies
wait 320
expect lift_y == 32
expect py == 18
hold RIGHT 32
expect py == 18
press B
wait 20
expect items & 2
expect deaths == 0
